id: flame-stance
name: Flame Stance
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 1
# Not a Combat Condition: the Stance Maneuver's mark, held till another Stance takes its place or it is left.
combatCondition: no
source: Martial Skill
description: >
  Increase your Wound Rolls and Might by 1(T), but reduce your Awareness by 1(T).
text: >
  Flame Stance. Increase your Wound Rolls and Might by 1(T), but reduce your Awareness by 1(T).

---

[passive]
wound += 1(T);
might += 1(T);
awareness -= 1(T);
